### USER OPERATIONS

### FIND ALL USERS
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### FIND USER BY ID
GET http://localhost:3000/users/1

### CREATE USER
POST http://localhost:3000/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser3",
  "password": "1234Abcd"
}
### LOGIN USER

POST http://localhost:3000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser3",
  "password": "1234Abcd"
}

### LOGOUT USER
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/logout


### POST OPERATIONS

### FIND ALL POSTS
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/

### FIND POST BY USER_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/1

### DELETE POST BY ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/posts/10

### SAVE POST
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 5,
  "body": "posted through http request!"
}
### EDIT POST
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/20
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "body": "edited through http request!!"
}

### COMMENT OPERATIONS

### FIND COMMENTS BY USER_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/comments/user/2

### FIND COMMENTS BY POST_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/comments/post/5

### GET LATEST COMMENT BY POST ID
GET http://localhost:3000/comments/post/first/5

### DELETE COMMENT BY ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/comments/10

### CREATE COMMENT
POST http://localhost:3000/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "post_id": 10,
  "user_id": 5,
  "body": "hey comments are visible!"
}
### EDIT COMMENT BY ID
PATCH http://localhost:3000/10
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "body": "edited through http request!!"
}

### LIKE OPERATIONS

### FIND LIKES BY USER_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/likes/user/1

### COUNT LIKES BY POST_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/likes/post/5

### IS POST LIKED BY USER_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/likes/post/5/user/1

### DELETE LIKE BY USER ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/likes/post/5

### SAVE LIKE BY POST ID
POST http://localhost:3000/likes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "post_id": "5"
}